[{"w":0.098468275070190431,"text":"67","y":0.033430232081967493,"x":0.04814004173186321,"h":0.050872093612227776},{"w":0.15328134536743165,"h":0.020711479345297934,"x":0.19250593658831683,"y":0.015807050950084167,"text":"WRITING"},{"y":0.058091286186876978,"w":0.12910284042358397,"h":0.011676155185303738,"x":0.1925601756671286,"text":"A factual article"},{"h":0.010174418089300752,"x":0.53391684929593108,"y":0.031976744274148095,"text":"1","w":0.013129101991653513},{"h":0.010373443983402564,"x":0.55579868630583917,"text":"Read the factual article below and choose the best","w":0.40262580871582032,"y":0.031950207440324507},{"h":0.01033623802216721,"y":0.04643071818207356,"text":"title for it.","w":0.081008634567260818,"x":0.56015213887071436},{"w":0.1706783294677735,"text":"a Health is important","y":0.065406976951462692,"x":0.56017506016764496,"h":0.011771446243855954},{"y":0.079941860686927768,"text":"b How to live a long life","w":0.19037199020385742,"x":0.56017505760594877,"h":0.011759384044473187},{"y":0.091923175937513868,"h":0.015774977751292552,"x":0.55991109209055068,"text":"c Live Strong, Live Long","w":0.19109292984008786},{"w":0.86433258056640627,"x":0.078774635956767577,"h":0.02332939290406788,"y":0.13808139586513468,"text":"Experts agree that if we were more carefre, we would live longer, happier lives. Additionally A, we should eat"},{"w":0.86652076721191396,"h":0.0132780086944706,"text":"a healthy, natural diet and stay active. Sounds easy, doesn't it? Unfortunately, it's not so simple. Even the place where you live can","y":0.15975103699564341,"x":0.078774636000169734},{"w":0.12472647666931153,"h":0.011772652384651194,"text":"make a difference.","y":0.1742738588324908,"x":0.078774617354622128},{"x":0.08091712167901513,"y":0.19174700656880683,"w":0.82722724914550771,"text":"According to scientists, there are a number of places around the world where citizens live longer. In Sardinia, men live for a","h":0.015285575835041976},{"w":0.88183807373046874,"h":0.016182572614107826,"y":0.20622406609650268,"x":0.076586442412664796,"text":"surprisingly long time. Many of them are shepherds and they eat mainly goats' cheese and milk. 'As well as that , they spend a"},{"y":0.22074688785060814,"h":0.016182572614107937,"x":0.076586436273447092,"w":0.69803062438964836,"text":"lot of time outside 'in order to O, look after their sheep. They are 'also , very relaxed. \"In contrast"},{"w":0.25431365966796876,"h":0.01612234155172132,"y":0.23415076962480419,"text":"active and live to a more normal age.","x":0.078567879987385222},{"y":0.25290697710549959,"text":"If you lived in Okinawa, a Japanese island, you could also reach a very old age. Understandably, this is for slightly different reasons.","w":0.88183807373046874,"h":0.015988371283186864,"x":0.076586442412664796},{"y":0.26597510397655089,"h":0.017455127921836455,"w":0.85557983398437498,"x":0.076586450868862815,"text":"Most people have a garden to grow their own food. 'As a result Opeople are active and get a lot of natural sunlight. They eat"},{"y":0.28049792549809827,"x":0.07658644176605009,"text":"food from their gardens \"so as not to , waste money, and they make sure not to overeat, 'so they stop eating when they are","h":0.017467190121219334,"w":0.87746170043945304},{"y":0.29792531087154916,"text":"80% full. ®Therefore , they stay fit and strong.","x":0.076586439398741032,"h":0.014574688796680557,"w":0.33698028564453125},{"x":0.080962839410057164,"w":0.84463890075683579,"text":"Unfortunately, walking around with sheep and growing vegetables is not an option for those of us who live in cities and have","h":0.014589163277653805,"y":0.31535269672245581},{"h":0.015988371283186864,"x":0.076586447143479924,"w":0.85557983398437487,"text":"school or jobs to attend. \"However O, we can try to have the same positive attitude that is common to the people of Sardinia","y":0.32848837233805772},{"text":"and Okinawa 1°so that","h":0.010373443983402453,"w":0.17067832946777339,"x":0.08096280747617883,"y":0.34439834042232453},{"y":0.34439834014820669,"w":0.18599561691284178,"text":"J we can grow very old too.","x":0.25382932734773661,"h":0.011706310683760934},{"h":0.011717166346633112,"x":0.052516403469098735,"y":0.38081395383130756,"w":0.44201313018798827,"text":"2 Read the article in Exercise 1 again. Label the linkers"},{"w":0.3741794204711914,"h":0.011705104542965694,"text":"in bold: C (show contrast), A (add information),","x":0.076586444797226816,"y":0.39534883750378824},{"y":0.40988372119564875,"x":0.080962801840765486,"text":"R (show result) or P (show purpose).","h":0.011693042343582816,"w":0.28227571487426756},{"w":0.38512035369873049,"text":"3 Match beginnings 1-5 with endings a-e. Then","x":0.054704598205339253,"y":0.43443983409946485,"h":0.011781095765933003},{"text":"complete the sentences with the linkers from the box.","x":0.078774631792197736,"w":0.42669582366943365,"y":0.44896265565734939,"h":0.011793157965315881},{"h":0.0132780086944706,"w":0.27133478164672853,"x":0.10065646132834978,"text":"additionally although as a result","y":0.47510373409297313},{"text":"as well as","w":0.081202468872070305,"x":0.098348437514552633,"h":0.011050562245222606,"y":0.49084099777562873},{"text":"in order to so as not to","h":0.010380681223889132,"x":0.19256017102097758,"w":0.19256017684936524,"y":0.49127906985554337},{"x":0.10503282481561235,"y":0.51598837220629667,"w":0.35229759216308598,"h":0.013081394686243808,"text":"It's important to eat a balanced diet in order to"},{"x":0.10503283234883845,"y":0.53195020734632126,"w":0.25382930755615229,"h":0.011654443463843922,"text":"People are eating more and more"},{"h":0.0116665056632268,"w":0.076586432456970249,"text":"fast food.","x":0.1028446380749431,"y":0.54647302897445782},{"w":0.28884025573730471,"h":0.011773858525446323,"text":"2 I spend two hours in the gym every","x":0.080962807186052213,"y":0.56250000023634639},{"x":0.10498030834819733,"h":0.010364930560480046,"y":0.57693962757528683,"w":0.041680521965026862,"text":"week"},{"y":0.59302325592580629,"text":"3","w":0.010940918922424325,"h":0.0087209297908292793,"x":0.0787746170431642},{"w":0.24070020675659187,"text":"You should warm up before you","h":0.013081394686243808,"x":0.10503283179675872,"y":0.59156976768231406},{"h":0.0072674414923576958,"y":0.61046511647610102,"x":0.10503282224178596,"w":0.063457331657409674,"text":"exercise"},{"y":0.54505813939779058,"w":0.021881837844848595,"text":"U","h":0.01308139547767484,"x":0.48577680558523434},{"y":0.6235465118972211,"w":0.013129101991653444,"text":"4","h":0.0087209297908291683,"x":0.078774617275508094},{"text":"going to bed early,","x":0.19912472738916356,"y":0.62199170121084379,"h":0.01327800829875514,"w":0.14660831451416015},{"h":0.013278008298755251,"text":"Scientists advise sleeping with the windows","w":0.32822757720947265,"x":0.1050328238679112,"y":0.63651452273239117},{"x":0.1050328235748491,"y":0.65552325604740391,"w":0.059080963134765616,"h":0.010174418089300863,"text":"open, -"},{"text":"a Icycle to work every day.","y":0.67427385875497148,"w":0.21663019180297849,"h":0.011772652384651194,"x":0.080962803989101537},{"text":"b you should avoid coffee in the evening.","h":0.013278007903039679,"x":0.080962804714731995,"y":0.68879668088467494,"w":0.32385120391845706},{"text":"c hurt yourself.","x":0.080915023681842765,"y":0.70328468240390263,"w":0.12482203483581543,"h":0.013488774279835858},{"x":0.080962811200251533,"y":0.71947674448053245,"w":0.21006563186645508,"text":"d it's too cold where I live.","h":0.011643587405256173},{"text":"e they are overweight.","w":0.18599561691284183,"h":0.011823313463772966,"x":0.080962806559990455,"y":0.73526970946121784},{"x":0.080779225072260985,"text":"f stay healthy.","w":0.12509363174438476,"y":0.74917899826158507,"h":0.014723398675562493},{"y":0.77034883732257586,"h":0.013081394686243808,"x":0.056892784703944412,"w":0.42888401031494139,"text":"4 Read the factual article So you think social media is"},{"w":0.34586597442626954,"x":0.080904821082740247,"y":0.7848261604455653,"text":"bad for you? Choose the correct words a-f.","h":0.013446711306750014},{"h":0.011677361326098978,"text":"5 Look at the words in bold in the article in Exercise 4.","w":0.44201313018798827,"x":0.056892782870994835,"y":0.80954356858290344},{"x":0.080962799905003782,"w":0.19256017684936522,"y":0.82406638995230819,"h":0.013278008298755251,"text":"Find pairs of synonyms."},{"w":0.18380743026733398,"h":0.011748528381600898,"text":"Teenagers = youngsters","x":0.10503282461833895,"y":0.843023255914641},{"h":0.0087209297908292793,"text":"2","w":0.010940918922424311,"x":0.083150984876862247,"y":0.87209302340400374},{"text":"3","w":0.010940918922424311,"h":0.0087209297908292793,"y":0.88662790712493433,"x":0.083150984876862247},{"text":"So you think SOCIAL MEDIA","y":0.38662790694039795,"w":0.3391684722900391,"h":0.023330599044863121,"x":0.5492341428953057},{"y":0.4100573671944574,"text":"is bad for you?","w":0.18009727478027349,"h":0.024362010085236419,"x":0.54890103492479692},{"y":0.44024896302655026,"x":0.54923413310381275,"w":0.41356674194335941,"h":0.017599873522999854,"text":"Teenagers face lots of criticism for spending too much time"},{"x":0.55142232876900754,"text":"online, and social media is often the reason. aHopefully, \/","y":0.45767634821926229,"h":0.017614348795404133,"w":0.40481399536132812},{"x":0.55142232282801207,"y":0.47674418636664284,"w":0.35229759216308587,"text":"Clearly, if youngsters spent all their time on these","h":0.015988371283186975},{"x":0.55142232942764779,"w":0.40262580871582032,"h":0.016187397177288565,"y":0.49418604684387168,"text":"platforms, they wouldn't complete homework assignments"},{"h":0.017626410994786901,"x":0.55142231743071901,"y":0.5101744188283569,"w":0.38293216705322264,"text":"on time. On top of that, they might come across online"},{"y":0.5276162792934731,"h":0.017611936513813653,"text":"bullies and, 'obviously \/surprisingly, they may be out of","w":0.39387306213378903,"x":0.55142233572741617},{"h":0.018895347880130031,"text":"shape as a result of being inactive. Therefore, should we be","y":0.54505814024961519,"w":0.40700218200683591,"x":0.55142231829636335},{"text":"disconnected all the time?","w":0.19256017684936522,"h":0.0132780086944706,"x":0.55142232050310724,"y":0.5639004148452178},{"h":0.017809484014867261,"text":"Interestingly, \/ Probably research shows a number of","x":0.55131409519244978,"w":0.36786079406738281,"y":0.58424854968674167},{"text":"benefits for people who regularly use online networks.","w":0.38949672698974613,"h":0.017526294977338486,"x":0.55142231971081612,"y":0.60165975109256054},{"h":0.019767124919970458,"x":0.55126123646004999,"y":0.61730569493621268,"text":"First of all, social media users have better relationships with","w":0.41391540527343751},{"x":0.55142233015740383,"y":0.63651452298817224,"w":0.40043762207031253,"h":0.017555243939284981,"text":"friends and family, both online and offline. They are more"},{"x":0.55142232682948267,"h":0.01756971921168915,"y":0.65394190833661514,"text":"sensitive and have a better ability to understand people's","w":0.39606124877929683},{"w":0.39606124877929683,"h":0.01889534788012992,"y":0.67005813982446993,"text":"feelings. As a result they find it easier to share their own","x":0.55142232928650037},{"x":0.5557656130386579,"y":0.69031586826301194,"w":0.072276215553283785,"h":0.011810123870976241,"text":"emotions."},{"x":0.55142232326133955,"y":0.71075581441291236,"text":"Additionally, online friends can be anywhere in the world","w":0.39824943542480462,"h":0.015988371283186864},{"text":"This is \"naturally \/ unfortunately a great opportunity to","x":0.5536105053388185,"y":0.7281976747508484,"w":0.38512035369873043,"h":0.015988371283186864},{"text":"learn about other cultures and communities.","x":0.55361050732676287,"y":0.74563953523318627,"w":0.30853391647338868,"h":0.013281626721140749},{"x":0.55361050103225518,"h":0.016182572614107937,"w":0.36105033874511727,"text":"Finally, people who use social media often use these","y":0.76597510409720138},{"h":0.017469602402809703,"y":0.78340248996069384,"x":0.55361051282239104,"w":0.37417942047119135,"text":"platforms to play games. ®Fortunately \/ Unfortunately,"},{"text":"experts say this is good for us. Gamers are often better at","w":0.39684738159179689,"y":0.79680919839842035,"h":0.023772381351201854,"x":0.55321097092174043},{"x":0.5557986933377147,"h":0.014672391741107571,"text":"visual tasks and get higher scores on tests connected to","y":0.81976744214136332,"w":0.37855579376220705},{"h":0.014657917260134323,"text":"space and coordination.","y":0.83720930269368887,"x":0.55579869645574931,"w":0.1663019561767578},{"y":0.85755813995433683,"text":"*Certainly \/ Sadly, there are many advantages to being part","w":0.417943115234375,"h":0.015988371283186864,"x":0.55142231128872066},{"h":0.015988371283186975,"text":"of an online community. With that in mind, next time your","x":0.55361050904363107,"w":0.40919036865234382,"y":0.87500000033224368},{"text":"parents tell you to get offline and live in the real world,","y":0.89244186085549959,"x":0.55361051602939182,"w":0.39824943542480473,"h":0.015988371283186864},{"y":0.90988372129833983,"x":0.55142233682105402,"h":0.014597606263220153,"text":"just share some of this information with them.","w":0.33260391235351561},{"h":0.015988371283186975,"y":0.92732558185217717,"text":"If you can't remember the advice, just check online!","x":0.55361049400990792,"w":0.36323852539062507},{"w":0.028446388244628903,"h":0.011627906387772335,"x":0.063457331326263217,"y":0.95784883744564875,"text":"82"}]